 result←object New arg;parent;name;props;newobj
⍝ style bits:
⍝ 0=Tabs
⍝ 1=Buttons
⍝ 2=NoTabs
⍝ 8=Multiline
⍝ 16=RaggedRight (8∊)
⍝ 32=FixedWidth
⍝ 64=ForceImageLeft (32∊)
⍝ 128=ForceLabelLeft (32∊)
⍝ 256=Limit Focus
⍝ 512=Immediate focus (~256∊)
⍝ 1024=Tabs on side (left)
⍝ 2048=Tabs on bottom or right
⍝ 4096=Keep lines intact; force 8 (don't reorder rows)
⍝ 8192=(reserved)
⍝ 16384=Flat buttons (1∊)
⍝ 32768=No separators (∧/1 16384∊)
⍝ 65536=Hot track

 (parent name)←object ⍝ Separate non-standard two-part argument
 arg,←(~arg ##._supp.HasInitialProps'style')/⊂'style' 0 ⍝ Force 'style' settings upon creation
 arg←(parent:parent)##.##.New.Center arg

 props←'TabControl'('Visible' 0) ⍝ Define properties that must be used during creation
 newobj←⎕VGET(parent⍕⍛,'.',name)##.##.∆WC props ⍝ Create the actual Dyalog object with required parameters
 result←parent newobj ##.##.New.Initialize arg ⍝ Complete standard class-initialization procedure
